{
	"info": {
		"name": "Doriath API Contract Suite",
		"description": "Newman/Postman API-contract tests for the Doriath (vault) Nextcloud app. Locks the HTTP contract of doriath's controllers (appinfo/routes.php + lib/Controller/*): secrets, encryption suites, CA status, folders, secret-types, and the public link-share access endpoint. Every family is exercised for a happy path, an error/validation case (4xx, not 500 where the controller is correct), and an authorization case (no auth -> 401, or 404 for the public token route). The suite is self-contained and idempotent: it creates the vault objects it needs (a secret, a folder) and deletes them again in teardown.\n\nThis suite asserts the Phase-0 fixes: secret create returns 201 with ownerType:\"user\" (not 500); secret/suite/folder reads return their list/object shape; the public link-share token route is reachable without NC auth and 404s on an unknown token.\n\nMost vault WRITES that mint or use key material (suite create, private-key upload, link-share create) require the in-browser RSA crypto flow and an unlocked vault with a freshly-generated key — they are not drivable from a headless API client and are QUARANTINED honestly below (covered by Playwright). What IS drivable from the API — because the dev vault already has an unlocked suite — is the full secret CRUD round-trip, folder create, and all the reads + authz, which this suite exercises.\n\nAUTH MODEL: collection auth is noauth; every authenticated request carries an EXPLICIT basic-auth block (admin:admin via adminUser/adminPass). The no-auth requests target {{noAuthBase}} (127.0.0.1) so the host-scoped NC session cookie established on {{baseUrl}} (localhost) is never sent to them. Run with --ignore-redirects. See run-newman.sh.\n\nGAP-4 FIX (previously quarantined): SecretController::create and EncryptionSuiteController::create now declare their required params nullable and validate presence in the body, so OMITTING a required field returns a clean JSON 400 instead of NC's reflection param-injection 500 HTML page. EncryptionSuiteController::create additionally catches InvalidArgumentException from the key-signing path, so an invalid public key also degrades to a 400. The corresponding create-error tests now assert 400 (not the old quarantined 500).",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{ "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
		{ "key": "noAuthBase", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8080" },
		{ "key": "adminUser", "value": "admin" },
		{ "key": "adminPass", "value": "admin" },
		{ "key": "secretId", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "folderId", "value": "" }
	],
	"auth": { "type": "noauth" },
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "1. Encryption suites + CA (reads)",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "List suites (200, ownerType shape)",
					"event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
						"pm.test('suites (200)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
						"const b = pm.response.json();",
						"pm.test('is an array', () => pm.expect(b).to.be.an('array'));",
						"if (b.length) { pm.test('suite carries ownerType', () => pm.expect(b[0]).to.have.property('ownerType')); pm.test('suite carries a certificate', () => pm.expect(b[0]).to.have.property('certificate')); }"
					] } } ],
					"request": { "auth": { "type": "basic", "basic": [ { "key": "username", "value": "{{adminUser}}", "type": "string" }, { "key": "password", "value": "{{adminPass}}", "type": "string" } ] }, "method": "GET", "header": [ { "key": "OCS-APIRequest", "value": "true" }, { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" } ], "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/index.php/apps/doriath/api/v1/suites", "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ], "path": [ "index.php", "apps", "doriath", "api", "v1", "suites" ] } }
				},
				{
					"name": "Show suite ERROR: unknown id -> 404 not 500",
					"event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
						"pm.test('unknown suite -> 404', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));",
						"pm.test('not a 500', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.not.eql(500));"
					] } } ],
					"request": { "auth": { "type": "basic", "basic": [ { "key": "username", "value": "{{adminUser}}", "type": "string" }, { "key": "password", "value": "{{adminPass}}", "type": "string" } ] }, "method": "GET", "header": [ { "key": "OCS-APIRequest", "value": "true" }, { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" } ], "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/index.php/apps/doriath/api/v1/suites/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000", "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ], "path": [ "index.php", "apps", "doriath", "api", "v1", "suites", "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000" ] } }
				},
				{
					"name": "List suites AUTHZ: anonymous -> 401",
					"event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [ "pm.test('anonymous rejected 401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));" ] } } ],
					"request": { "method": "GET", "header": [ { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" } ], "url": { "raw": "{{noAuthBase}}/index.php/apps/doriath/api/v1/suites", "host": [ "{{noAuthBase}}" ], "path": [ "index.php", "apps", "doriath", "api", "v1", "suites" ] } }
				},
				{
					"name": "CA status (200, healthy shape)",
					"event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
						"pm.test('ca status (200)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
						"const b = pm.response.json();",
						"pm.test('has status field', () => pm.expect(b).to.have.property('status'));"
					] } } ],
					"request": { "auth": { "type": "basic", "basic": [ { "key": "username", "value": "{{adminUser}}", "type": "string" }, { "key": "password", "value": "{{adminPass}}", "type": "string" } ] }, "method": "GET", "header": [ { "key": "OCS-APIRequest", "value": "true" }, { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" } ], "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/index.php/apps/doriath/api/v1/ca/status", "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ], "path": [ "index.php", "apps", "doriath", "api", "v1", "ca", "status" ] } }
				},
				{
					"name": "CA status AUTHZ: anonymous -> 401",
					"event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [ "pm.test('anonymous rejected 401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));" ] } } ],
					"request": { "method": "GET", "header": [ { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" } ], "url": { "raw": "{{noAuthBase}}/index.php/apps/doriath/api/v1/ca/status", "host": [ "{{noAuthBase}}" ], "path": [ "index.php", "apps", "doriath", "api", "v1", "ca", "status" ] } }
				},
				{
					"name": "Create suite ERROR: invalid public key -> 400 (not 500)",
					"event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
						"// Suite creation mints/uploads RSA key material generated in the browser",
						"// (the unlock/keygen flow); the real happy path is covered by Playwright",
						"// e2e against the unlocked vault UI. From a headless client we can only",
						"// probe the contract boundary, and that boundary is currently BUGGY:",
						"// BUG 1 (param injection): EncryptionSuiteController::create declares two",
						"// non-nullable string params; omitting either triggers NC reflection",
						"// param-injection 500 (same class as SecretController::create).",
						"// BUG 2 (uncaught key error): with BOTH fields supplied, an invalid public",
						"// key makes CaService::signPublicKey throw an InvalidArgumentException, but",
						"// create() only catches RuntimeException, so it escapes -> 500 HTML page",
						"// instead of a clean 400.",
						"// GAP-4 fix: the controller now validates presence AND catches the bad-key",
						"// path (InvalidArgumentException), so this invalid-key request returns a",
						"// clean 400 instead of a 500. (Was QUARANTINED at 500.)",
						"pm.test('invalid public key is a 400 client error (not 500)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));"
					] } } ],
					"request": { "auth": { "type": "basic", "basic": [ { "key": "username", "value": "{{adminUser}}", "type": "string" }, { "key": "password", "value": "{{adminPass}}", "type": "string" } ] }, "method": "POST", "header": [ { "key": "OCS-APIRequest", "value": "true" }, { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"publicKey\": \"not-a-real-rsa-public-key\",\n  \"encryptedPrivateKey\": \"NEWMAN-placeholder-encrypted-private-key\"\n}" }, "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/index.php/apps/doriath/api/v1/suites", "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ], "path": [ "index.php", "apps", "doriath", "api", "v1", "suites" ] } }
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "2. Secrets",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "List secrets (200, items shape)",
					"event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
						"pm.test('secrets (200)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
						"const b = pm.response.json();",
						"pm.test('has items array', () => pm.expect(b.items).to.be.an('array'));"
					] } } ],
					"request": { "auth": { "type": "basic", "basic": [ { "key": "username", "value": "{{adminUser}}", "type": "string" }, { "key": "password", "value": "{{adminPass}}", "type": "string" } ] }, "method": "GET", "header": [ { "key": "OCS-APIRequest", "value": "true" }, { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" } ], "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/index.php/apps/doriath/api/v1/secrets", "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ], "path": [ "index.php", "apps", "doriath", "api", "v1", "secrets" ] } }
				},
				{
					"name": "Create secret (201, ownerType:user — Phase-0 fix)",
					"event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
						"pm.test('secret created (201)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
						"const b = pm.response.json();",
						"pm.test('returns an id', () => pm.expect(b.id).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);",
						"pm.test('ownerType is user (Phase-0 fix)', () => pm.expect(b.ownerType).to.eql('user'));",
						"pm.test('ownerId is admin', () => pm.expect(b.ownerId).to.eql('admin'));",
						"pm.test('echoes the encrypted key blob', () => pm.expect(b.key).to.eql('NEWMAN-encrypted-blob-placeholder'));",
						"pm.collectionVariables.set('secretId', b.id);"
					] } } ],
					"request": { "auth": { "type": "basic", "basic": [ { "key": "username", "value": "{{adminUser}}", "type": "string" }, { "key": "password", "value": "{{adminPass}}", "type": "string" } ] }, "method": "POST", "header": [ { "key": "OCS-APIRequest", "value": "true" }, { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"NEWMAN probe secret\",\n  \"key\": \"NEWMAN-encrypted-blob-placeholder\"\n}" }, "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/index.php/apps/doriath/api/v1/secrets", "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ], "path": [ "index.php", "apps", "doriath", "api", "v1", "secrets" ] } }
				},
				{
					"name": "Show secret (200, id matches)",
					"event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
						"pm.test('secret read (200)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
						"pm.test('id matches created', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().id).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('secretId')));"
					] } } ],
					"request": { "auth": { "type": "basic", "basic": [ { "key": "username", "value": "{{adminUser}}", "type": "string" }, { "key": "password", "value": "{{adminPass}}", "type": "string" } ] }, "method": "GET", "header": [ { "key": "OCS-APIRequest", "value": "true" }, { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" } ], "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/index.php/apps/doriath/api/v1/secrets/{{secretId}}", "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ], "path": [ "index.php", "apps", "doriath", "api", "v1", "secrets", "{{secretId}}" ] } }
				},
				{
					"name": "Update secret (200, name changed)",
					"event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
						"pm.test('secret updated (200)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
						"pm.test('name updated', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().name).to.eql('NEWMAN probe secret renamed'));"
					] } } ],
					"request": { "auth": { "type": "basic", "basic": [ { "key": "username", "value": "{{adminUser}}", "type": "string" }, { "key": "password", "value": "{{adminPass}}", "type": "string" } ] }, "method": "PUT", "header": [ { "key": "OCS-APIRequest", "value": "true" }, { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"NEWMAN probe secret renamed\"\n}" }, "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/index.php/apps/doriath/api/v1/secrets/{{secretId}}", "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ], "path": [ "index.php", "apps", "doriath", "api", "v1", "secrets", "{{secretId}}" ] } }
				},
				{
					"name": "Show secret ERROR: unknown id -> 404 not 500",
					"event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
						"pm.test('unknown secret -> 404', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));",
						"pm.test('not a 500', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.not.eql(500));"
					] } } ],
					"request": { "auth": { "type": "basic", "basic": [ { "key": "username", "value": "{{adminUser}}", "type": "string" }, { "key": "password", "value": "{{adminPass}}", "type": "string" } ] }, "method": "GET", "header": [ { "key": "OCS-APIRequest", "value": "true" }, { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" } ], "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/index.php/apps/doriath/api/v1/secrets/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000", "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ], "path": [ "index.php", "apps", "doriath", "api", "v1", "secrets", "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000" ] } }
				},
				{
					"name": "Create secret ERROR: empty key -> 400 (InvalidArgument)",
					"event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
						"// An empty-string key is present (so NC param injection succeeds) but the",
						"// service rejects it with InvalidArgumentException -> a clean 400. This is",
						"// the controller's REAL validation path.",
						"pm.test('empty key rejected 400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));",
						"pm.test('not a 500', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.not.eql(500));"
					] } } ],
					"request": { "auth": { "type": "basic", "basic": [ { "key": "username", "value": "{{adminUser}}", "type": "string" }, { "key": "password", "value": "{{adminPass}}", "type": "string" } ] }, "method": "POST", "header": [ { "key": "OCS-APIRequest", "value": "true" }, { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"bad\",\n  \"key\": \"\"\n}" }, "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/index.php/apps/doriath/api/v1/secrets", "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ], "path": [ "index.php", "apps", "doriath", "api", "v1", "secrets" ] } }
				},
				{
					"name": "Create secret ERROR: missing required field -> 400 (not 500)",
					"event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
						"// GAP-4 fix: SecretController::create now validates name/key are present, so",
						"// OMITTING a required field returns a clean JSON 400 instead of NC's",
						"// reflection param-injection 500 HTML error page. (Was QUARANTINED at 500.)",
						"pm.test('missing-required field is a 400 client error (not 500)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));"
